 the cutting of drivers and damage to surrounding structures. d.2 Physical phenomenon: CLI1: Catastrophic natural event (sism, volcanic, alluvial, tidal, etc.). d.3 Reiterating Physical Phenomenon in the affected installation: this installation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months. Physical Phenomenon in installations of the same owner: 13 faults have been produced in installations of the same owner with the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months. FALLA_ID ZONE_FALLA DATE_FALLA ACTIONS Falla in line 66 kV EAF 277_2023 The company CGE Transmission S.A.D.D. aqu\u00eds - Huala\u00f1\u00e9 T","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 347/2024\n\u201cFalla en l\u00ednea 66 kV Curanilahue Norte - Tres Pinos\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 23-08-2024\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 01/08/2024\nHora 11:41\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 11.13\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 10476\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.106 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nL\u00ednea 66 kV Horcones - Curanilahue Norte /\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n\nLT228CI1TR01T0058ST01T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea de transmisi\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada E.\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b0 5561 Piso 14, las Condes, Santiago, Chile\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nL\u00ednea 66 kV Curanilahue Norte - Tres Pinos /\nNombre del elemento fallado\nLT230CI1TR01T0058ST01T0058\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada E.\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b0 5561 Piso 14, las Condes, Santiago, Chile\nd.1 Origen y c